            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KVN2003"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made these tonight as muffins instead of a loaf. The only other changes I made were to include 1 c. whole wheat flour, Italian style stewed tomatoes, a little less oil and no olives. Overall they weren't very flavorful which surprised me because I thought there were plenty of aromatics and other elements involved to make a good finished product. We just didn't care for them. They were very heavy in texture.",
